Z||000000||FIEROGOD||01-25-2001||02:55 AM|||| Maybe someone might know how and where to find what i am thinking about. Back in 86 or 87 coke gave away a red or garnet fastback. I only remember seeing a poster of it. I would have been 13 or 14. I have talked to several people who collect coke stuff but nobody knows anything about it. I would like to buy any memorabilia that anyone would like to part with. If someone remebers this please respond or email me. THANKS!!!!!!!!!||||reg||6
Z||000001||mrfiero||01-25-2001||03:08 AM||||I'm sure wkayl will reply to this when he reads it.....he works for Coke and remembers the giveaway.  It was a bright red '86 GT.....red & silver, just like Coke's colors.<P>I don't think he has any memorabilia, but he might be able to fill you in on the details of the contest.<P>||||reg||10
Z||000002||theogre||01-25-2001||08:05 PM||||I believe Coke is in the process of turning over their entire andvertising library to the Library of Congress. If this promo was a Coke one then it will likely be in that collection. Check <A HREF="http://www.loc.gov" TARGET=_blank>www.loc.gov</A>  for details.||||reg||1
Z||000003||wkayl||01-25-2001||08:52 PM||||Here is a picture of the one we gave away in 1986.  I wish I would have kept the shelf talkers (the things that had the price) and p.o.s. (point of sale) material from then.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grandopening_3.jpg">  <P>And here is a picture of my car.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/myfiero_1.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outline.jpg">    <BR>86GT original paint, interior, engine  <A HREF="http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html</A> <p>[This message has been edited by wkayl (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
